{
  "name": "a contributor is told a city and a country, never a street",
  "description": "ADR-0024 decision 7 and its contributor and contact-email bodies.\n\nA contributor learns a city for the first time. A contact request — and an opening, which shares its role shape — carries each entry at the contributor's level of detail: `{\"mode\": \"remote\", \"country\": …}` with null for anywhere, and `{\"mode\": \"onsite\", \"country\": …, \"city\": …}`. Never a street, a postcode or an address id: the address is the organisation's, and somebody who has not even answered yet has no use for where its front door is.\n\nThe contact EMAIL carries one phrase built from the same entries at the same detail. Its wording is not fixed by the ADR — country names come from the place service and fall back to the code — so the message is asserted by what it must contain (both cities) and what it must not (either street, either postcode, either second line). Today the email says 'at their office', which names no city at all.",
  "seed": ["principals", "catalogue", "repositories", "scored_population"],
  "steps": [
    {
      "_step": "A role at both offices, or remote in Britain. The HIRER reads every address in full.",
      "as": "hank",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "path": "/org-roles/01920000-0000-7000-8000-00000000b001/roles",
        "body": {
          "title": "Field engineer",
          "engagement": "full_time",
          "locations": [
            {
              "mode": "onsite",
              "address_id": "{{acme.address.austin}}"
            },
            {
              "mode": "onsite",
              "address_id": "{{acme.address.main}}"
            },
            {
              "mode": "remote",
              "country": "GB"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "capture": {
        "role": "$.id"
      },
      "expect": {
        "status": 201,
        "body": {
          "id": "<uuid>",
          "organization_id": "01920000-0000-7000-8000-00000000b001",
          "status": "draft",
          "title": "Field engineer",
          "description": "",
          "engagement": "full_time",
          "locations": [
            {
              "mode": "remote",
              "country": "GB",
              "address": null
            },
            {
              "mode": "onsite",
              "country": null,
              "address": {
                "id": "01920000-0000-7000-8000-0000000ad001",
                "country": "IN",
                "city": "Bengaluru",
                "postal_code": "560001",
                "street1": "1 MG Road",
                "street2": "Floor 4",
                "is_main_office": true,
                "removed": false
              }
            },
            {
